The Hero sections for **Services** and **Contact** now share the exact same aesthetic as the **About** page:
- **Background**: Soft gradient (`bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/50 to-white`).
- **Typography**: Large, bold orange titles (`text-5xl md:text-7xl text-orange-500`).
- **Consistency**: Added the same decorative divider and spacing for a cohesive brand experience.

